	(text "Carpet driver: one low-side AO3400 + 330R pull-up from VUS (14.4 V). The P-FET half-bridge was removed:\nits 100k gate pull-up could not turn it off at 290 kHz (shoot-through). R7012 holds LO low in reset/flash.\nDrive LO in short bursts only: LO stuck high puts 0.63 W into R7011."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 98.425 40.005 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6c119fe5-c150-41dd-abf9-e5cafcd2ec25")
	)
	(text "C7303 AC-couples LO to the Q18 gate: if LO sticks high, the gate decays through R7012 (~10 ms)\nand Q18 turns off, so R7011 is never stressed by firmware holding LO high."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 209.55 75.057 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 255 0 255 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b1e49baa-e657-4a9c-918a-fbe9f877f5b0")
	)
